// TWO ENUMS DECLARING THE SAME THREE NAMES IN DIFFERENT ORDERS.
//
// The orders are what make a wrong answer visible. A tag is an index, so
// `Tag.Two` is 1 and `Echo.Two` is 0; give the two enums the same order
// and every question this file asks has one answer by accident.
Tag*  = One | Two | Three

Echo* = Two | Three | One
